[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17161.35, "timestamp": "04:46:01", "text": "当你姐姐生气时，事情就会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17163.99, "timestamp": "04:46:03", "text": "开始进攻等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17167.19, "timestamp": "04:46:07", "text": "我快饿死了。呃，稍等一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17169.59, "timestamp": "04:46:09", "text": "这里。这里。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17172.55, "timestamp": "04:46:12", "text": "我不小心把它吃掉了。哦，不。哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17174.23, "timestamp": "04:46:14", "text": "妈的。我忘了你不能吃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17176.868, "timestamp": "04:46:16", "text": "浆果。算了，没事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17179.35, "timestamp": "04:46:19", "text": "我忘了你是个肉食爱好者。我的意思是，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17181.03, "timestamp": "04:46:21", "text": "可以等等，你有多少HP？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17184.07, "timestamp": "04:46:24", "text": "有？实际上已经72岁了，而且还在排水。好的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17185.51, "timestamp": "04:46:25", "text": "可以给你怪物肉。坚持，稍等。让"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17186.788, "timestamp": "04:46:26", "text": "让我先把怪物肉煮了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17189.27, "timestamp": "04:46:29", "text": "然后你就可以把它吃了。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17192.708, "timestamp": "04:46:32", "text": "过来。呃，我加入了一个蜘蛛氏族。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17200.868, "timestamp": "04:46:40", "text": "如何才能提高我的理智水平？呃，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17203.75, "timestamp": "04:46:43", "text": "带束花。是的。哦，是的。如果你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17206.31, "timestamp": "04:46:46", "text": "即将开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17208.55, "timestamp": "04:46:48", "text": "告诉我，既然我需要召唤，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17214.708, "timestamp": "04:46:54", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17216.948, "timestamp": "04:46:56", "text": "你很久没发脾气了。我拿走了。"}]